From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 15:50:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add the Microsoft Surface Laptop 8

Document the Microsoft Surface Laptop 8 with the 13.8-inch display, which
is built on the 12-core Snapdragon X2 Elite (Mahua).

Qualcomm's posted series for the same laptop uses another compatible and
asks the maintainers which name to use. This one matches the board device
tree carried here until that name is settled.

Assisted-by: Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index ff8a35df786..f1f3716fdbc 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -177,6 +177,7 @@ properties:
 
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - microsoft,surface-laptop8
               - qcom,mahua-crd
           - const: qcom,mahua
 
-- 
